1
00:00:00,380 --> 00:00:02,590
Dinner for four, under twenty bucks.

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:07,770
One pot, one pan, and a creamy lemon dill
sauce you're gonna want on everything.

3
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,670
Today we're making creamy lemon dill
broccoli pasta.

4
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:18,682
We're hitting Sobeys, we're keeping it
under twenty, and I'll show you the

5
00:00:18,682 --> 00:00:19,550
