First stop, Sobeys. The list is short.

7
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:31,450
Broccoli crowns. We grabbed about three
quarters of a kilo.

8
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:36,194
It's sold by weight, so pick tight, deep
green heads and skip anything turning

