12
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:45,750
Compliments cream cheese, the plain brick.

13
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:49,630
Two hundred fifty grams, three ninety-
nine. That's the base of our sauce.

14
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:52,850
And the secret weapon: SZN Lemon Dill.

15
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:57,770
Bright lemon, big dill flavour, and it
