18
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:08,370
Got some chicken left from last night?
Perfect.

19
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:12,950
That's it. Broccoli, rotini, cream cheese.
Three items.

20
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:18,190
Back home, get a big pot of salted water
going and cook the rotini to the package.

21
