23
00:01:26,140 --> 00:01:27,810
While that cooks, the broccoli.

24
00:01:28,140 --> 00:01:32,427
Cut the florets off the crown and keep 'em
bite size, so they cook fast and catch the

25
00:01:32,427 --> 00:01:32,730
