26
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:37,870
Now the chicken. Slice up that leftover
breast. Nothing fancy.

27
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:43,790
Big skillet, a little oil, medium heat. In
goes the broccoli and the chicken.

28
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:48,060
Cook it till the broccoli's bright green
and tender crisp, and the chicken's hot

29
00:01:48,060 --> 00:01:48,750
