30
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:53,510
Now the cream cheese. The whole brick, cut
into chunks so it melts faster.

31
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:59,450
Add half a cup of that pasta water and
stir till it melts down nice and smooth.

32
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,610
Here's where the magic happens.

33
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:07,555
SZN Lemon Dill. About two and a half
tablespoons, or just shake till it looks

34
00:02:07,555 --> 00:02:07,910
