36
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:16,210
Drain the rotini and dump it right in.

37
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:17,510
Toss it all together.

38
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:22,590
If it looks a little tight, add pasta
water a splash at a time, till it's glossy

39
00:02:22,590 --> 00:02:23,910
